# ================================================================
00:00:00.00>CRE DEP001,A21N,16.052628,108.201989,80.9,0,0
00:00:00.00>PCALL _KB5GEN_PUSHBACK_G26 DEP001 _KB5GEN_TAXI_G26_RWYHOLD 44.5
